#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "a11yfy – PDF Accessibility Checker & Fixer"
msgstr "a11yfy – PDF Accessibility Checker & Fixer"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://a11yfy.com/wordpress"
msgstr "https://a11yfy.com/wordpress"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Free in-browser PDF accessibility scan (Matterhorn Protocol machine checks) and one-click PDF/UA-1 remediation via the "
"a11yfy service."
msgstr "通过 a11yfy 服务，提供免费的浏览器内 PDF 可访问性扫描（基于 Matterhorn Protocol 的机器检查）以及一键式 PDF/UA-1 修复功能。"

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "a11yfy"
msgstr "a11yfy"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://a11yfy.com"
msgstr "https://a11yfy.com"

